(199, 'Building The Perfect PC', 481081.00, 100, 2, 'This popular Build-It-Yourself (BIY) PC book covers every step in building one''s own system: planning and picking out the right components, step-by-step assembly instructions, and an insightful discussion of why someone would want to do it in the first place.', 'book', NOW()),
