(234, 'Technical Analysis of Stock Trends', 495634.00, 87, 3, 'Based on the research and experience of Dow, Schabacker, and Edwards, Technical Analysis of Stock Trends, Ninth Edition presents proven techniques, methods, and procedures for success, even in today‘s unpredictable markets. New and updated material on Dow Theory and long term investing, including new tables of', 'book', NOW()),
