(391, 'Jungle (Pacemaker Classic Series)', 372512.00, 78, 4, 'With its high-interest adaptations of classic literature and plays, this series inspires reading success and further exploration for all students.These classics are skillfully adapted into concise, softcover books of 80-136 pages. Each retains the integrity and tone of the original book. Interest Level: 5-12 Reading Level: 3-4', 'book', NOW()),
